    "content": "<p>Attention, Pilots! The following hotfix will be deployed for War Robots: Frontiers following a short period of maintenance on<strong> June 3, 2025.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>General Adjustments</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Launched a new Intel event.\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li>Intel from Daily Jobs is increased by 50%.</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Technical Improvements</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Fixed various issues that led to crashes on PS4, PS5, and Xbox consoles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Fixed a bug where the buttons &ldquo;Play&rdquo; and &ldquo;Social&rdquo; for some new players on Xbox would become unresponsive.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Follow the game on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a> and join the <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">official Discord server</a> to get all the latest hotfix info.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need help? Contact our <a href=\"https://support.my.games/wrf_int\">Support team</a> to report any issues you&rsquo;re facing on the Wild Ten.</p>",
